<title>POLAND: Gorazdze revises up 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>Gorazdze revises up 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gorazdze preliminary results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			36.51 vs   47.20</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  55.88 vs   59.74</p>
<p>    net profit				55.71 vs   59.46</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Zaklady Cementowo-Wapiennicze Gorazdze SA. The company earlier showed in its Q4 report 1996 net at 43.16 million, pre-tax at 43.33 million and operating profit at 23.96 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales				229.54 vs  219.93</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 144.08 vs  118.10</p>
<p>    extraordinary	  loss	    0.27 vs    0.03</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.16 vs    0.28</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    21.77 vs   15.59</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.11 vs    3.01</p>
<p>    investment				59.19 vs   18.31</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
